WEBVTT

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.980
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.770
I hope we have a good time together

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.620
Today let's keep

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.240
Sharing laughs

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:26.670
You take care of my true wishes in secret

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:34.220
You always cheer me up after bad days

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:40.580
I'm sure everyone has known it since childhood

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:49.250
You pretend you don't care, but you're always a good friend

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:58.650
You have another busy day as a god; you just can't help but help out others

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:04.990
Everyone is cheered up by your love

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:13.300
I love always being together while you help others

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:20.820
I'll protect that precious smile; you know what I mean

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.820
When it's a lucky day with nice weather

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:28.400
We should go visit the shrine together

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.500
It's been raining all day long.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:14.590
Yeah, really. It's making me feel
so sluggish and unmotivated.

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:19.680
No need to sigh. It's not like it makes
much different to you, Mayu-sama.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.440
Thump-gasp-shock-whew!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.830
R-Right.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.470
I'm having fun. It's your turn next, Mayu-sama!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.880
May I come in?

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:31.570
Yes!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.240
Yuzu-chan, are you around?

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:35.580
Coming!

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:39.350
I have to get back to the shop, please excuse me.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.850
All right, I'll handle everything on this end.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.840
Oh, thank you.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.850
How about these picture plates
to give it that autumn feel?

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.260
This autumn tinted one looks very nice.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:53.020
Yes.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.580
But I guess I should get the red dragonfly one.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:03:01.360
That small red dragonfly plate is Kutani ware, so it has an interesting vermilion shade.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.100
I see!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.330
The two of us aren't enough for Daihinmin.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.070
Not that three people would be good enough either.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:38.530
Wh-What's wrong, Mayu-sama? You look unusually melancholy!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.910
What about it, Yoshino? I was just buried in thought.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:49.120
I was reminiscing about when I first came here.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.110
I want to hear that story!

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:58.210
We have nothing else to do anyway, so tell me the story!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.940
Well, I don't mind telling you...

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:07.600
but it's like a ghost story.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.110
So brace yourself!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.600
A ghost story?

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:23.330
Yes, back when I was still in Takamagahara...

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:29.020
Mayu...

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.000
Yes.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:38.220
I believe I grounded you for a week's time because you
dissipated your divine powers without my acquiescence.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:42.720
Yet it appears you have failed to
understand just what I meant.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.390
N-No, I understand it perfectly well, Mother!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:49.520
I see, you <i>understand it well</i>, do you?

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:53.340
You extirpated from your cell, journeyed
to an ignominious gambler's din,

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:57.990
and engaged in gambling, yet you somehow believe your actions to be excusable!

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:01.740
I plan to reflect upon my egregious crimes once more.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:06.040
Maybe breaking out of the cell was a bad idea.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:11.300
Poor Mayu-sama.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.380
What were you thinking, Mayu?

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:18.050
Dear, why don't we let her off now?

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.750
Mayu looks sorry for what she did.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:25.050
Of course she does! My wrath would
be far more strident were she not!

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:29.810
It appears you know not what it means to be grounded.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.580
Calm down, dear. Just this time...

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:34.860
You mean "this time <i>again</i>"!

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:42.060
"Why don't we let her off again this time?
Mayu looks sorry for what she did."

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.570
"I am gravely apologetic for my actions, Mother!"

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.670
"Oh, see that?"

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:50.750
"You are at fault for spoiling Mayu."

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:56.290
"Regardless, I cannot <i>just</i> ground you this time!"

00:05:58.510 --> 00:05:59.880
Step.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.450
"I am revoking your divine powers indefinitely!"

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:06.110
"Until I bade for your return, you are
hereby banished from Takamagahara!"

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.430
"You will come to know the consequences of your actions."

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:20.590
S-So by ghost story you meant your mother is scary!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:23.850
I shouldn't have gotten frightened!

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.600
Y-You idiot, that's not the scary part!

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.560
That was just the prologue.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.420
Prologue?

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.950
C-Can we stop?

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.780
It's still midday, but it feels like the sun's set.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:55.590
I regained consciousness in a lonely,
abandoned shrine after falling down to Earth.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:01.230
And sure enough, I found there...

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.260
Sure enough?

00:07:03.260 --> 00:07:06.760
...a wandering evil spirit.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.920
It hurts.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:21.870
Where am I?

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:27.920
It looks like a shrine.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:43.610
I sense no divine or human presence.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.580
Is it an abandoned shrine?

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:50.810
This is perfect! I didn't want to live in
a stuck-up place like Takamagahara anyway!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:52.880
Actually, I feel great!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.440
I wouldn't go back even if you asked me to!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.920
Hey, you, right there.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.400
Who is it?

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.130
I'm right here. Look right in front of you.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.350
So you've finally noticed me?

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.750
You're just as stupid as you look, girl.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:19.040
This place has been my turf for over ten years.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:24.340
No one may enter this place without my permission.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:31.750
You think you're tough enough
to be claiming your turf?

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:38.250
You barely deserve the "turf" of half a tatami mat with that weakly figure you have now.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.000
Isn't that right, random ghost?

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.840
What about you then? Let me hear it.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:09:00.550
Try not to act surprised. Entrusted to protect the scriptures and ritual implements by Amaterasu,

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:06.510
and entrusted to protect humans'
sleep and memory by Tsukuyomi...

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:09.490
is my dad, head of the cat god family.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:11.550
What? I can't hear you!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.380
What exactly are you trying to say you are?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.040
Huh?

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:19.600
Wh-Whatever.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.210
Anyhow, I'm a goddess.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:27.400
<i>You're a goddess? That's hard to believe.</i>

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.450
Are you really a goddess?

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:49.920
Yes... well, at least technically.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.750
Say...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.380
Hm?

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:56.380
If you really are a goddess, I'd like to ask you for a favor.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:03.380
I'm willing to hand over this turf
if you do me the favor.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.300
What do you say?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:16.510
Today I tried to show my mature charm for a change!

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:53.570
A favor?

00:10:53.570 --> 00:11:00.890
Indeed, I want you to help a human girl in my stead.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:05.300
It should be simple for a goddess, right?

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:10.330
She's been visiting this old shrine
with a pretty glum face recently.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:16.380
I want to grant her wish, if she has one.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:22.360
You're just a cat. Why would you care about a human girl?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:23.910
She has nothing to do with you.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:32.340
Well, it's just that we kind of know each other.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:18.040
Kotetsu, Kotetsu!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:20.110
Here!

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.320
Kotetsu, here!

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.160
Here, here!

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.500
Mike, you too!

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:30.000
Keep at it!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:56.020
The girl lost her parents when she was a child, and now
she looks after the shop her parents left behind all alone.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:00.540
Isn't that admirable? What do you think?

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.030
A trite story.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:09.290
Well, don't say that. Unlike us cats, humans...

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:12.930
apparently have a pretty hard time living alone.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:19.050
So, please take care of her.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.630
I'll get back at you if you make her cry.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.800
Hey, I didn't say I'd grant your favor yet—

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:06.680
Hey, you girl over there.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.160
I'm right here.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.940
Let's see...

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:24.420
I have been deeply impressed by
your devotion, a rare trait these days.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:29.800
I will grant you a wish as a reward.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:34.680
A cat monster?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.680
No, I am a goddess!

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.050
Just hurry up and tell me your wish!

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:39.850
My wish?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:43.170
Yes, anything is fine.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:46.320
Jeez, why do I have to do this?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.600
Y-You don't have a wish?

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:55.130
N-No need to hold it back, okay?

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:58.610
Oh no, I am not holding it back.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.960
So you don't have to follow me.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.880
D-Don't be so cold, okay?

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:07.480
You were praying so intently back there!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.430
You can wish for a thriving business,

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.710
perfect health,

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.440
family safety,

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:18.550
a good match,

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.190
anything really.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:25.090
I wonder why I'm being so desperate here.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.830
A promise like that doesn't really matter to me...

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:30.640
Okay?

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:43.340
Please get below my umbrella
if you're going to follow me.

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.860
You're making me feel chilly.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.680
Say, Goddess...

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.870
Can I make any wish?

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:15.070
Y-Yes, anything is fine!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.290
Though I have my strong points and weak points.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:21.640
Well, can I ask you to find something?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:25.150
Finding a lost item is my absolute specialty!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.630
So, what do you want me to find?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.010
Then...

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:32.510
please find my cat, Kotetsu.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.520
Eh?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:41.060
He used to always come back home for dinner, but he hasn't been showing up lately.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:46.320
He's gotten pretty old, so I am a little worried.

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:55.460
I-Is your Kotetsu, a grumpy-looking
male cat with a scar over his left eye?

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:58.610
That's amazing! How did you know?

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.590
I'd expect nothing less from a goddess!

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:04.090
Is that really your wish?

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:06.590
Yes, please.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:11.370
That's one of the reasons
I visited the shrine just now.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.590
That damned cat!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.600
He wants me to take care of her?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.210
He didn't know a thing...

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:27.440
about this poor girl!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.740
Goddess?

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.490
Very well.

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.210
Um...

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.260
This is my garden.

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:01.880
Uh, what's the matter?

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:04.770
I-It's nothing!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:08.460
Can you close your eyes for a bit?

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:13.320
I hate to admit it, but my divine
powers are pretty weak right now.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:19.970
I don't think I can work my powers otherwise.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.470
I'm sorry, Goddess.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:34.930
To be honest, I realize I'm asking you for something impossible.

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.950
Be quiet! I can't concentrate!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:43.140
Kotetsu won't come back.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.370
I heard cats disappear when they sense they're going to die.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.240
But...

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:55.480
I was so sad I couldn't even say goodbye!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:05.200
Come on, you've broken the promise, Goddess.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:09.210
Remember I'll get back at you if you make her cry?

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.720
Kotetsu?

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:26.230
Sorry I went away without saying a word.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:33.500
But I just couldn't help it.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:37.980
We cats have our own way of doing things...

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:41.500
You don't understand cat language, do you?

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:46.120
Hey, Goddess, translate for me.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.080
Kotetsu.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.890
I'm back.

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:59.280
Welcome home.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:34.100
And then?

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.400
And then what happened?

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:37.660
Many things.

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.980
Say, Kotetsu.

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:52.420
You said that day people have a hard time living
alone, but the same applies to us cats and cat gods.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:57.300
We pretend to act tough, but everyone
feels lonely when they're alone.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.080
So what are those many things?

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:04.820
Many things are many things. If I start
talking about them, it'll go on forever.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.310
That's mean, Mayu-sama!

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:08.970
Tell me!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.760
I am busy!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:14.070
I need to continue playing games.

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.230
I'm really curious!

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:18.570
Time to set out on a new adventure!

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:25.250
Speaking of which, my wish for a
thriving business never came true.

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:26.870
Hello, Yuzu-san!

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:31.020
I've brought fried tofu. It'll be a good side dish for dinner!

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:34.500
Sorry for using the shop entrance when I'm not a customer.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.530
All right Gonta, move.

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:39.680
Mayu, I'm not a customer, but Meiko's here!

00:21:39.680 --> 00:21:43.240
Sorry we're not customers, Yuzu-sama. Please excuse us.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.160
Welcome, everyone!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:48.370
It suddenly got rowdy in here.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.200
Gonta, can you close the door?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:52.250
Mayu-sama, don't ignore me! Tell me!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.250
Why? I was here first!

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:54.540
I'll close the door!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.700
What are those many things? Tell me!

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:09.190
I gently peered into the future which we call tomorrow

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:13.320
Looking at the world upside down

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:20.360
I projected my memories upon the glittering cotton candy clouds

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:24.490
And hung rainbow ribbons

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:31.790
When I'm left alone, I feel lonely and depressed

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:38.260
So stay here forever

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:43.510
I'm sure everyone has some

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:49.430
Unfulfilled desires locked inside their hearts

00:22:51.690 --> 00:23:01.610
I want you to realize that small memory that won't disappear is the key. Yeah

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.080
You're always the only one

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:12.370
Who can make me reminisce fondly

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:41.370
Next Episode

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:31.220
Mayu-sama, so these "rats" are not actually rats?

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:35.480
Yes, Yuzu, they are same yet different.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.010
Let me write it out for you.

00:23:37.010 --> 00:23:38.610
Oh, they <i>are different!</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:41.370
Lost Cat on the Earth

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:41.550
Tune in next week to see the difference!
